{"id":"u127","kelas":"travel","no":6,"judul":"Darurat dan Kesehatan di Luar Negeri","title":"Emergencies and Health Abroad","emoji":"🚑","ringkas":"Meminta tolong, polisi, apotek, dokter, dan kehilangan barang","ready":true,"goals":["meminta **pertolongan** dengan kalimat jelas dan singkat","menyebut **gejala sakit** dan alergi kepada dokter atau apoteker","melapor **kehilangan barang** kepada polisi","mengenali **kata darurat**: emergency, ambulance, police"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Dalam keadaan darurat, kalimat pendek dan jelas jauh lebih penting daripada tata bahasa sempurna. Hafalkan kata-kata berikut dan pola **I need ...**, **I have lost ...**, **My ... hurts.**"},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Darurat","items":[{"en":"emergency","id":"keadaan darurat","ex":"This is an emergency!"},{"en":"ambulance","id":"ambulans","ex":"Please call an ambulance."},{"en":"police","id":"polisi","ex":"I need to call the police."},{"en":"fire","id":"kebakaran","ex":"There is a fire in the building!"},{"en":"help","id":"bantuan / menolong","ex":"Help! I need help!"},{"en":"accident","id":"kecelakaan","ex":"There was a car accident."},{"en":"hurry","id":"cepat / bergegas","ex":"Please hurry!"},{"en":"safe","id":"aman","ex":"Are you safe?"}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Kesehatan","items":[{"en":"pharmacy","id":"apotek","ex":"Where is the nearest pharmacy?"},{"en":"prescription","id":"resep dokter","ex":"I need a prescription for this medicine."},{"en":"allergy","id":"alergi","ex":"I have an allergy to penicillin."},{"en":"fever","id":"demam","ex":"I have a high fever."},{"en":"headache","id":"sakit kepala","ex":"I have a bad headache."},{"en":"stomachache","id":"sakit perut","ex":"I have a stomachache."},{"en":"insurance","id":"asuransi","ex":"Do you accept my travel insurance?"},{"en":"clinic","id":"klinik","ex":"Is there a clinic near here?"}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kehilangan dan polisi","items":[{"en":"stolen","id":"dicuri","ex":"My wallet was stolen."},{"en":"lost","id":"hila